{"slug":"2020-an-efficient-approach-for-numerical-simulation-of-concrete-filled-round-ended-steel-tubes","title_zh":"圆端形钢管混凝土数值模拟的高效方法","title_en":"An efficient approach for numerical simulation of concrete-filled round-ended steel tubes","authors":["Qiang Zhang","Lei Fu","Lei Xu"],"year":2020,"journal":"Journal of Constructional Steel Research","volume":"170","article_number":"106086","doi":"10.1016/j.jcsr.2020.106086","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcsr.2020.106086","language":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"英文摘要"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Concrete-filled round-ended (CFRE) steel tubes are widely used in civil infrastructures. Accurate and reliable numerical models of CFRE steel tube are significantly important to mimic the actual behavior. This study presents a fiber beam-column model to simulate nonlinear behavior of CFRE steel tubes. A group of uniaxial hysteretic constitutive models was defined for the properties of the material. To verify the reliability of the presented fiber model, a large number of numerical computations have been performed by the fiber model and a traditional refined finite element model. The results confirm that the proposed fiber model can accurately predict the nonlinear behavior of CFRE steel tubes. Finally, two empirical models for the prediction of the axial bearing capacity of CFRE steel tube columns were developed."},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"中文摘要"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"圆端形钢管混凝土（CFRE）广泛应用于土木基础设施。准确、可靠的圆端形钢管混凝土数值模型对于模拟其实际行为十分重要。本研究提出一种纤维梁柱模型，用于模拟圆端形钢管混凝土的非线性行为，并定义了一组单轴滞回本构模型来描述材料特性。为验证所提出纤维模型的可靠性，采用该纤维模型和传统精细有限元模型进行了大量数值计算。结果证实，所提出的纤维模型能够准确预测圆端形钢管混凝土的非线性行为。最后，建立了两个用于预测圆端形钢管混凝土柱轴向承载力的经验模型。"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"**中文关键词：** 圆端形钢管混凝土；纤维梁柱模型；有限元分析；经验模型"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"**英文关键词：** Concrete-filled round-ended steel tube; Fiber beam-column model; Finite element analysis; Empirical model"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"研究思想"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"圆端形钢管混凝土截面由中部矩形与两端半圆组成，适合用于需要较大横向刚度、同时希望减小水流作用的桥墩。两端曲面钢管与中部平直钢板对混凝土的约束不同，统一采用一种混凝土本构关系，难以反映这种截面差异。传统壳—实体精细模型能够处理接触与局部变形，但建模和求解负担较重；常规纤维模型又难以直接表现钢板局部屈曲。"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"论文的思路是在已有纤维梁柱框架中，将截面约束差异转化为不同纤维的单轴材料响应，并通过钢材本构退化表示局部屈曲对承载能力的影响。这样既保留梁单元的计算简化，又使材料积分反映圆端形截面的主要非线性机制。在此基础上，再建立便于估算短柱轴压承载力的简化方法。"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"方法"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"模型采用铁木辛柯梁单元，将核心混凝土分为两端半圆内的约束区和中部矩形内的部分约束区，并分别配置混凝土纤维与钢纤维。ABAQUS的Python程序根据截面尺寸生成纤维坐标，以“*rebar”方式定义钢管；FORTRAN编写的UMAT在材料积分点更新应力和切线刚度，再经截面积分形成节点内力与整体刚度，迭代求解构件响应。"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"材料模型主要建立在既有研究之上：普通混凝土受压采用Hognestad模型，受拉考虑开裂前弹性及开裂后的拉伸刚化；约束混凝土上升段采用Mander形式，峰后段结合Liang等人的关系，分别描述半圆区和矩形区的承载保持与软化；循环卸载、再加载规则采用已有滞回模型。钢材骨架曲线包括弹性、屈服和强化阶段，并考虑包辛格效应及局部屈曲引起的强度退化。论文的主要贡献是这些本构关系与圆端形分区、纤维梁柱计算的结合，并非提出全部基础材料理论。"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"用于对照的精细模型以C3D8R实体单元模拟混凝土及加载板，以S4R壳单元模拟钢管，钢管与混凝土间采用接触关系，切向库仑摩擦系数为0.3。"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"轴压简化分析沿两条路径展开：一是分别计算两端约束区与中部部分约束区的承载力后叠加；二是借助已有等效截面方法，按长宽比将圆端形截面近似为圆形或矩形，再结合约束指标建立经验关系。后一方法以约1.44为截面转换分界，给出的承载力关系覆盖长宽比1至4。"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"基本结论"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"在所比较的静力和拟静力试件中，提出的纤维模型能够较好再现纯弯、轴压和往复加载下的整体响应，包括屈服、强化及卸载过程。局部屈曲通过材料强度退化间接计入，因此模型对整体承载与滞回的吻合，不能等同于直接重现钢板局部屈曲形态。"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"轴压参数分析表明，混凝土强度、钢材屈服强度及截面比例均影响承载力。在相应算例中，钢材屈服强度由235 MPa提高至345、420和550 MPa，极限承载力分别增加18%、34%和61%；B/t由80增加至90、100和110时，轴压承载力分别降低15%、26%和37%，初始刚度也随之降低。这些百分比属于论文选定参数组合下的比较。"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"纯弯试件中，较大的B/D对应更大的截面尺寸和抗弯承载力，不能据此推断相同截面面积下改变形状仍有同样增益。两种经验方法为普通材料圆端形钢管混凝土短柱提供了轴压估算途径。论文强调纤维模型的效率优势，但没有给出可用于量化加速比的统一耗时或内存对照。"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"算例与验证"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"纯弯验证选取两根四点加载试件，表列B/D为1和1.5，并与试验、精细有限元及OpenSees纤维模型比较。两试件实测极限弯矩分别为51.4和100.8 kN·m，本文纤维模型预测为52.1和97.8 kN·m，精细模型预测为50.6和99.5 kN·m。作者指出，所比较的OpenSees模型对圆端形约束效应考虑不足，极限弯矩预测偏保守。"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"往复加载验证从既有16根柱试验中选取两根，轴压比分别为0.2和0.4，比较水平荷载—位移滞回响应及强度退化。轴压曲线验证采用既有试验中的六组试件，混凝土强度为40.4 MPa，钢材强度约为299至311 MPa；两种数值模型总体上与试验曲线吻合。另以Wang等人的轴压试验检验等效截面方法，并汇集多组短柱承载力比较两种经验方法。验证主要支持所选构件的静力、拟静力整体响应，未提供整体桥梁动力分析或现场监测验证。"}],"glossary":[{"zh":"圆端形钢管混凝土","en":"Concrete-filled round-ended steel tube","explanation":"核心混凝土由中部平直段和两端半圆形钢管包围的组合构件，简称CFRE。","terms":[{"id":"C7160263578a03f609578","zh":"圆端形钢管混凝土","en":"concrete-filled round-ended steel tubes","domain":"材料与结构工程","group_id":"H8ed2f7bb76bc4054a759","abbreviations":[]}],"word_links":{"zh":null,"en":{"id":"Wa3fd11fd4c7fbe0ff9d058ab","group_id":"Wa3fd11fd4c7fbe0ff9d058ab","zh":"","en":"Concrete-filled round-ended steel tube","name":"Concrete-filled round-ended steel tube","language":"en","domain":"文献术语","domains":[],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"context","families":[]}}},{"zh":"纤维梁柱模型","en":"Fiber beam-column model","explanation":"将截面划分为单轴材料纤维，通过积分获得构件内力与刚度。","terms":[{"id":"Cb582fdd69f3aaec233aa","zh":"纤维梁柱模型","en":"fiber beam-column model","domain":"材料与结构工程","group_id":"Hfd970e071029424891eb","abbreviations":[]}],"word_links":{"zh":null,"en":{"id":"W07308d3f17e5457e5209f6ae","group_id":"W07308d3f17e5457e5209f6ae","zh":"","en":"fiber beam-column model","name":"fiber beam-column model","language":"en","domain":"材料与结构工程","domains":["材料与结构工程"],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":"Cb582fdd69f3aaec233aa","scope":"core","families":[]}}},{"zh":"铁木辛柯梁单元","en":"Timoshenko beam element","explanation":"本文纤维模型采用的梁单元基础，可考虑剪切变形。","terms":[],"word_links":{"zh":null,"en":{"id":"W07c74f6656e7b34a2ecd1b4f","group_id":"W07c74f6656e7b34a2ecd1b4f","zh":"","en":"Timoshenko beam element","name":"Timoshenko beam element","language":"en","domain":"文献术语","domains":[],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"context","families":[]}}},{"zh":"平截面假定","en":"Assumption of planes remaining planes","explanation":"将截面纤维的纵向应变与梁的截面变形联系起来的运动学假定。","terms":[],"word_links":{"zh":null,"en":{"id":"W23f3138f0118fc834bec7554","group_id":"W23f3138f0118fc834bec7554","zh":"","en":"Assumption of planes remaining planes","name":"Assumption of planes remaining planes","language":"en","domain":"文献术语","domains":[],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"context","families":[]}}},{"zh":"单轴滞回本构模型","en":"Uniaxial hysteretic constitutive model","explanation":"描述纤维材料在循环加载下应力、应变及历史状态的关系。","terms":[{"id":"Ced3234c1cc12e75b1f62","zh":"单轴滞回本构模型","en":"uniaxial hysteretic constitutive models","domain":"材料与结构工程","group_id":"He27372bd92b76b1082ce","abbreviations":[]}],"word_links":{"zh":null,"en":{"id":"W119164cf1fe88fd629cea63a","group_id":"W119164cf1fe88fd629cea63a","zh":"","en":"Uniaxial hysteretic constitutive model","name":"Uniaxial hysteretic constitutive model","language":"en","domain":"文献术语","domains":[],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"context","families":[]}}},{"zh":"约束混凝土","en":"Confined concrete","explanation":"位于两端半圆区域、受到曲面钢管侧向约束的核心混凝土。","terms":[],"word_links":{"zh":null,"en":{"id":"W3a680fd1168306be1c7d3fd2","group_id":"W3a680fd1168306be1c7d3fd2","zh":"","en":"Confined concrete","name":"Confined concrete","language":"en","domain":"文献术语","domains":[],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"context","families":[]}}},{"zh":"部分约束混凝土","en":"Partially confined concrete","explanation":"位于中部矩形区域、受到平直钢板有限约束的混凝土。","terms":[],"word_links":{"zh":null,"en":{"id":"W545a15cc7f562edcd0dfb9e3","group_id":"W545a15cc7f562edcd0dfb9e3","zh":"","en":"Partially confined concrete","name":"Partially confined concrete","language":"en","domain":"文献术语","domains":[],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"context","families":[]}}},{"zh":"骨架曲线","en":"Backbone curve","explanation":"确定材料单调响应及循环滞回包络的基本应力—应变曲线。","terms":[],"word_links":{"zh":null,"en":{"id":"Wabd5c3c8a23cc4907ccf61cc","group_id":"Wabd5c3c8a23cc4907ccf61cc","zh":"","en":"Backbone curve","name":"Backbone curve","language":"en","domain":"文献术语","domains":[],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"context","families":[]}}},{"zh":"拉伸刚化效应","en":"Tension stiffening effect","explanation":"混凝土开裂后仍承担部分拉力的作用，影响模型受拉响应。","terms":[],"word_links":{"zh":null,"en":{"id":"Wb8c3f42b73af8cf38a6b0a8a","group_id":"Wb8c3f42b73af8cf38a6b0a8a","zh":"","en":"Tension stiffening effect","name":"Tension stiffening effect","language":"en","domain":"文献术语","domains":[],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"context","families":[]}}},{"zh":"弥散裂缝模型","en":"Smeared crack model","explanation":"将开裂影响分布到材料本构中，用于描述开裂后的拉伸响应。","terms":[],"word_links":{"zh":null,"en":{"id":"We3c4b5791b88e9f758fda551","group_id":"We3c4b5791b88e9f758fda551","zh":"","en":"Smeared crack model","name":"Smeared crack model","language":"en","domain":"文献术语","domains":[],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"context","families":[]}}},{"zh":"断裂能","en":"Fracture energy","explanation":"混凝土受拉软化关系中的参数，用于确定开裂后的刚度。","terms":[],"word_links":{"zh":null,"en":{"id":"W5d0d0b073333a54e7892a7be","group_id":"W5d0d0b073333a54e7892a7be","zh":"","en":"Fracture energy","name":"Fracture energy","language":"en","domain":"文献术语","domains":[],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"context","families":[]}}},{"zh":"局部屈曲","en":"Local buckling","explanation":"钢管壁板局部失稳，本文通过钢材本构中的强度退化计入其影响。","terms":[{"id":"C366b0bf648b4dc16a259","zh":"局部屈曲","en":"local buckling","domain":"材料与结构工程","group_id":"H16864936606a83a26f3a","abbreviations":[]}],"word_links":{"zh":null,"en":{"id":"Wada61d0e25ec5bbac3f86830","group_id":"Wada61d0e25ec5bbac3f86830","zh":"","en":"local buckling","name":"local buckling","language":"en","domain":"材料与结构工程","domains":["材料与结构工程"],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":"C366b0bf648b4dc16a259","scope":"core","families":[]}}},{"zh":"强度退化","en":"Strength deterioration","explanation":"钢管局部屈曲等作用导致承载能力下降的现象。","terms":[],"word_links":{"zh":null,"en":{"id":"W902c1d00f62ec33b85b55387","group_id":"W902c1d00f62ec33b85b55387","zh":"","en":"Strength deterioration","name":"Strength deterioration","language":"en","domain":"文献术语","domains":[],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"context","families":[]}}},{"zh":"包辛格效应","en":"Bauschinger effect","explanation":"钢材反向加载时屈服特性改变的现象，影响滞回模拟精度。","terms":[],"word_links":{"zh":null,"en":{"id":"W3ab606fb8f267718e82380a4","group_id":"W3ab606fb8f267718e82380a4","zh":"","en":"Bauschinger effect","name":"Bauschinger effect","language":"en","domain":"文献术语","domains":[],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"context","families":[]}}},{"zh":"用户自定义材料子程序","en":"User-defined materials subroutine","explanation":"简称UMAT，在ABAQUS积分点执行本文材料状态更新。","terms":[],"word_links":{"zh":null,"en":{"id":"Wbd4e1a10f71dfd5b4ffe1807","group_id":"Wbd4e1a10f71dfd5b4ffe1807","zh":"","en":"User-defined materials subroutine","name":"User-defined materials subroutine","language":"en","domain":"文献术语","domains":[],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"context","families":[]}}},{"zh":"材料积分点","en":"Material integration point","explanation":"计算纤维应力、本构刚度并参与截面积分的位置。","terms":[{"id":"Cc38b0bcb05c721be72c8","zh":"材料积分点","en":"material integration point","domain":"材料与结构工程","group_id":"Haabd36bf8cb338cae528","abbreviations":[]}],"word_links":{"zh":null,"en":{"id":"W9c6938e4b0618a7c4fef2b2f","group_id":"W9c6938e4b0618a7c4fef2b2f","zh":"","en":"material integration point","name":"material integration point","language":"en","domain":"材料与结构工程","domains":["材料与结构工程"],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":"Cc38b0bcb05c721be72c8","scope":"core","families":[]}}},{"zh":"精细有限元模型","en":"Refined finite element model","explanation":"采用壳、实体及接触关系描述钢管与混凝土相互作用的对照模型。","terms":[{"id":"Cdfa9d12be2c3c47fdfed","zh":"精细有限元模型","en":"refined finite element model","domain":"材料与结构工程","group_id":"H88e1cbb88c0c243cf41f","abbreviations":[]}],"word_links":{"zh":null,"en":{"id":"W25041755010c2c754cf5a0f5","group_id":"W25041755010c2c754cf5a0f5","zh":"","en":"refined finite element model","name":"refined finite element model","language":"en","domain":"材料与结构工程","domains":["材料与结构工程"],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":"Cdfa9d12be2c3c47fdfed","scope":"core","families":[]}}},{"zh":"库仑摩擦","en":"Coulomb friction","explanation":"钢管与混凝土界面切向接触采用的摩擦关系。","terms":[],"word_links":{"zh":null,"en":{"id":"We496979dce9fb794b0541d03","group_id":"We496979dce9fb794b0541d03","zh":"","en":"Coulomb friction","name":"Coulomb friction","language":"en","domain":"文献术语","domains":[],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"context","families":[]}}},{"zh":"等效截面划分方法","en":"Equivalent division method","explanation":"按截面长宽比将圆端形截面近似为圆形或矩形的简化方法。","terms":[],"word_links":{"zh":null,"en":{"id":"W740eb48517bab29f095bb094","group_id":"W740eb48517bab29f095bb094","zh":"","en":"Equivalent division method","name":"Equivalent division method","language":"en","domain":"文献术语","domains":[],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"context","families":[]}}},{"zh":"约束指标","en":"Confinement index","explanation":"以钢材和混凝土的强度、面积组合衡量约束作用，进入简化承载力关系。","terms":[],"word_links":{"zh":null,"en":{"id":"Wbccd63343b47737cee69f9d7","group_id":"Wbccd63343b47737cee69f9d7","zh":"","en":"Confinement index","name":"Confinement index","language":"en","domain":"文献术语","domains":[],"abbreviations":[],"concept_id":null,"scope":"context","families":[]}}}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C366b0bf648b4dc16a259","zh":"局部屈曲","en":"local buckling","domain":"材料与结构工程","group_id":"H16864936606a83a26f3a","abbreviations":[]},{"id":"C7160263578a03f609578","zh":"圆端形钢管混凝土","en":"concrete-filled round-ended steel tubes","domain":"材料与结构工程","group_id":"H8ed2f7bb76bc4054a759","abbreviations":[]},{"id":"C73d51755e371d125598f","zh":"经验模型","en":"empirical models","domain":"材料与结构工程","group_id":"H95e504b4023f56d57c49","abbreviations":[]},{"id":"C8e0973e6022dbe34ff80","zh":"轴向承载力","en":"axial bearing capacity","domain":"材料与结构工程","group_id":"H17a8fb9ee278511645be","abbreviations":[]},{"id":"Ca46509b9c08e141dd612","zh":"非线性行为","en":"nonlinear behavior","domain":"材料与结构工程","group_id":"H497bb5fe1e668f5ecce5","abbreviations":[]},{"id":"Cb582fdd69f3aaec233aa","zh":"纤维梁柱模型","en":"fiber beam-column model","domain":"材料与结构工程","group_id":"Hfd970e071029424891eb","abbreviations":[]},{"id":"Cc38b0bcb05c721be72c8","zh":"材料积分点","en":"material integration point","domain":"材料与结构工程","group_id":"Haabd36bf8cb338cae528","abbreviations":[]},{"id":"Cdfa9d12be2c3c47fdfed","zh":"精细有限元模型","en":"refined finite element model","domain":"材料与结构工程","group_id":"H88e1cbb88c0c243cf41f","abbreviations":[]},{"id":"Ced3234c1cc12e75b1f62","zh":"单轴滞回本构模型","en":"uniaxial hysteretic constitutive models","domain":"材料与结构工程","group_id":"He27372bd92b76b1082ce","abbreviations":[]}]}